            "review_title": "Review at Bun Bo Hue",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nFantastic Local Option in a VERY non-Touristy Area\nApr 2019 • Solo\nSo much of TripAdvisor's reviews are restricted to the major tourist destinations. However, this restaurant is a gem. I was biking around looking for a place to eat and ended up here. Honestly, I picked it because I was starving and the owner came out and saw me trying to make up my mind. Like many local restaurants of this class, it has a very limited menu. There were four major options - beef pho, beef fried rice, beef noodles and beef with vegetables. I went with the beef noodles and loved it. It was so cheap - only 30,000 Vietnamese dong (about $1.50) and came with a bowl of broth and an iced tea! What a deal. The staff was fascinated by my presence and kept checking in with me. Overall, it was a great experience!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 21, 2019",
